<title>USA: Hertz Corp to sell $250 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Hertz Corp to sell $250 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hertz Corp plans to sell $250 million in seven-year debt via Merrill Lynch &amp; Co on Thursday, according to Merrill Lynch syndicate officials.</p>
<p>Price talk on the deal is around 55 basis points over comparable Treasuries, the officials said.</p>
<p>-U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-895-1662</p>
</text>
